          {
            "title": "Question: del",
            "id": 96242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co zostanie wyświetlone przez poniższy kod?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"side = \" /><text value=\"&quot;salad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"meal = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steak&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", side]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meal[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(side)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"salad\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>salad</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nic, zostanie wyświetlony błąd</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>chips</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>salad</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które stwierdzenie opisuje zmienne <code>meal</code> i <code>side</code> po wykonaniu <code>del meal[-1]</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"side = \" /><text value=\"&quot;salad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"meal = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steak&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", side]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meal[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(side)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"salad\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">meal nie zawiera już salad, ale side nadal przechowuje salad</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Zarówno meal, jak i side tracą wartość salad</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">meal nadal zawiera salad, ponieważ side przechowuje tę samą wartość</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">meal nie zawiera już salad, ale side nadal przechowuje salad.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: del list item",
            "id": 96244,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Użyj <code>del</code>, aby usunąć ostatni element z <code>shopping</code>, jeśli lista zawiera więcej niż 3 elementy.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;bananas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;oranges&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemons&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;carrots&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;beans&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" len(shopping) &gt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shopping[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"104\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['bananas', 'oranges', 'lemons', 'carrots']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>del shopping[-1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: del uses",
            "id": 96247,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>  Za pomocą <code>del</code> można usunąć które z poniższych elementów?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dowolne odwołanie do obiektu, w tym elementy struktur danych</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tylko części listy</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tylko pary klucz:wartość w słowniku</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dowolne odwołanie do obiektu, w tym elementy struktur danych.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Za pomocą <code>del</code> można usunąć odwołanie do obiektu, w tym element znajdujący się w strukturze danych.</p><p>Jeśli <code>scores</code> przechowuje listę, która para może zawierać dwa prawidłowe cele instrukcji <code>del</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">scores i scores[0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tylko scores[0], ponieważ zmiennych nie można usuwać</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tylko scores, ponieważ elementów listy nie można usuwać</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz scores i scores[0].</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: del object",
            "id": 96245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij kod tak, aby <code>cookies</code> zostało usunięte, jeśli ostatni element krotki <code>permissions</code> ma wartość <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;site_access&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;adverts&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"permissions = (\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" permissions[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] == \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cookies deleted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Cookies deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>-</code>, następnie <code>1</code>, a potem <code>del</code>, <code>cookies</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usuń <code>cookies</code>, gdy <strong>ostatni</strong> element krotki <code>permissions</code> ma wartość <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;site_access&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;adverts&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"permissions = (\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" permissions[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] == \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cookies deleted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Cookies deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>-</code>, następnie <code>1</code>, <code>==</code>, <code>del</code> i na końcu <code>cookies</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: clean dict",
            "id": 96246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij kod, aby usunąć <code>Jason</code> ze słownika <code>users</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dave&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Manager&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;CEO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Apprentice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"keys\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Dave': (27, 'Manager'), 'Alexis': (33, 'CEO')}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>del</code>, następnie <code>users</code> i na końcu <code>\"Jason\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usuń ze słownika użytkownika, którego rola to <code>Apprentice</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dave&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Manager&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;CEO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Apprentice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"keys\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Dave': (27, 'Manager'), 'Alexis': (33, 'CEO')}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>del</code>, następnie <code>users</code> i na końcu <code>\"Jason\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: negative stepping",
            "id": 96337,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij kod, aby wyświetlone zostało <code>[\"H\", \"e\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\"]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scrambled = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;y&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;o&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;a&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;f&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;H&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;z&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hello = scrambled[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(hello)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['H', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>2</code>, następnie <code>-</code> i na końcu <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zacznij od <code>H</code> za pomocą ujemnego indeksu, zatrzymaj się przed indeksem <code>2</code> i cofaj się co dwa, aby wyświetlić <code>[\"H\", \"e\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\"]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scrambled = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;y&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;o&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;a&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;f&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;H&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;z&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hello = scrambled[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(hello)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['H', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>-2</code>, następnie <code>2</code>, <code>-</code> i na końcu <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: start values",
            "id": 96330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jakie temperatury zostaną wyświetlone?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[14, 16, 17, 12, 11]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wszystkie</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Brak - zostanie zgłoszony błąd</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Wszystkie oprócz pierwszego</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz Wszystkie.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które wyrażenie daje tylko dwie ostatnie temperatury, <code>[12, 11]</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[14, 16, 17, 12, 11]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>temperatures[-2:]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>temperatures[2:]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>temperatures[-2]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>temperatures[-2:]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: stop values",
            "id": 96332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które z poniższych stwierdzeń dotyczących wartości <code>end</code> jest prawdziwe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>end</code> może być dowolną liczbą całkowitą, dodatnią lub ujemną</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wartość <code>end</code> musi być zawsze uwzględniona</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Wartość <code>end</code> musi być większa niż wartość <code>start</code>, aby uniknąć zgłoszenia błędu</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>end</code> może być dowolną liczbą całkowitą, dodatnią lub ujemną.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wartość <code>end</code> wycinka może być dodatnią lub ujemną liczbą całkowitą. Można ją również pominąć.</p><p>Jaką funkcję pełni <code>-1</code> w wyrażeniu <code>letters[1:-1]</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wyznacza ostatnią pozycję jako nieuwzględniony koniec</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sprawia, że wycinek jest nieprawidłowy, ponieważ koniec jest ujemny</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Automatycznie odwraca wycinek</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wyznacza ostatnią pozycję jako nieuwzględniony koniec.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: start:stop:step",
            "id": 96339,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jakie litery zostaną wyświetlone przez poniższy kod?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"alphabet = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"selection = alphabet[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(selection)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['B']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">  tylko <code>B</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nic nie zostanie wyświetlone</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>A</code> i <code>B</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">  tylko <code>B</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poniższy wynik dotyczy wycinka w obecnej postaci. Co przechowywałaby zmienna <code>selection</code>, gdyby wycinek zmienił się na <code>alphabet[-2:-1:-1]</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"alphabet = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"selection = alphabet[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(selection)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['B']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Pusta lista</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>['B']</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>['B', 'A']</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz Pusta lista.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: negative stepping",
            "id": 96340,
